258
00:19:23,100 --> 00:19:33,000
麦琪:你说如果一个陌生人搬过来,你会让他付房租.而你说如果一个陌生人搬过来,你爸不会要求他遵守这些愚蠢的规定.
Maggie: You said that if a stranger moved in that you'd expect him to pay rent. And you said that if a stranger moved in, he wouldn't be expected to live by your dad's stupid rules.

259
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:34,700
杰森:愚蠢的规定?
Jason: Stupid rules?

260
00:19:34,700 --> 00:19:39,400
麦琪:我只是引用而已.但是,亲爱的,我们可以有一个解决办法了.
Maggie: I was just quoting. But the point is, honey, we may have stumbled on to a solution.

261
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:40,400
